    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Q16. Why last part as test set? To preserve time order.\n",
        "\n",
        "Q17. Predictions vs actual: Generally close, follow observed pattern."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YpjPxx3qIQ0o"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Step 7: Plot Actual vs Predicted**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "sy0ZzbTDIRzY"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "plt.figure(figsize=(8,4))\n",
        "plt.plot(results['Month'], results['Sales'], marker='o', label='Actual')\n",
        "plt.plot(results['Month'], results['Predicted_Sales'], marker='o', label='Predicted')\n",
        "plt.legend(); plt.xticks(rotation=45); plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
