        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Q18. Does ML follow direction? Yes, captures upward/downward movements.\n",
        "\n",
        "Q19. Why forecast differs? Model simplification, noise, or unseen factors."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "g4IO8E4HIcqR"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Step 8: One-Step ML Forecast**3\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "wDwLYAngIgJU"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "next_input = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        " 'Lag_1':[data['Sales'].iloc[-1]],\n",
        " 'Lag_2':[data['Sales'].iloc[-2]],\n",
        " 'Lag_3':[data['Sales'].iloc[-3]]\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "ml_forecast = model.predict(next_input)[0]\n",
        "print(round(ml_forecast,2))\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
